flowchart TD
    %% Escalation rules flowchart
    rec[Recommendation Ready] --> checkRisk{Evaluate Safety Risk}
    
    checkRisk -- "Risk < 2 (Low)" --> auto[Auto-execution / Dispatch]
    checkRisk -- "Risk 2 - 3 (Medium)" --> sup[Supervisor Approval Required]
    checkRisk -- "Risk >= 4 (Critical)" --> coord[Coordinator Approval Lock]
    
    sup --> |Approved| auto
    sup --> |Rejected/Override| manual[Manual Planner Override]
    
    coord --> |Approved| auto
    coord --> |Rejected/Override| manual
